{"id": "q0435", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4147165912, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Who are the top NFL Quarterbacks?", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0435.wav", "input_sha256": "76e25f78573b3827ab9e1d37488f278a1702e8964fd422175326798024b26a18", "input_samples": 31600, "input_s": 1.975, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.8247, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "As of entering the 2026 NFL season, the top NFL quarterbacks are generally considered to be: Josh Allen — Buffalo Bills , Joe Burrow — Cincinnati Bengals , Lamar Jackson — Baltimore Ravens , Patrick Mahomes — Kansas City Chiefs , Justin Herbert — Los Angeles Chargers , Jalen Hurts — Philadelphia Eagles , C.J. 1 and identify the top tier as Allen, Burrow, Jackson, and Mahomes. (pff.com)", "expert_answer": "As of entering the **2026 NFL season**, the top NFL quarterbacks are generally considered to be:\n\n1. **Josh Allen — Buffalo Bills**\n2. **Joe Burrow — Cincinnati Bengals**\n3. **Lamar Jackson — Baltimore Ravens**\n4. **Patrick Mahomes — Kansas City Chiefs**\n5. **Justin Herbert — Los Angeles Chargers**\n6. **Jalen Hurts — Philadelphia Eagles**\n7. **C.J. Stroud — Houston Texans**\n8. **Matthew Stafford — Los Angeles Rams**\n9. **Jayden Daniels — Washington Commanders**\n10. **Brock Purdy — San Francisco 49ers**\n\nPFF’s 2026 rankings put **Josh Allen** at No. 1 and identify the top tier as Allen, Burrow, Jackson, and Mahomes. ([pff.com](https://www.pff.com/news/nfl-player-rankings?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "Who are the top NFL quarterbacks?\n", "asr_s": 0.6, "expert_s": 5.58, "expert_i